rned one. The original stayed with Captain Jack Thorne."}, {'n': 6, 'title': 'The Tide Returns', 'text': "The new crew was young and wide-eyed. Captain Jack Thorne read them the articles, including the added one. They cheered, the way crews do. Pirates are sentimentalists. It's why they survive.\n\nloyalty above gold. Full sail. The horizon, as always, was just the beginning.\n\nA year later, a new a royal pardon surfaced — they always do — and Captain Jack Thorne was packed before the ink dried. the quartermaster closed the tavern for 'renovations' and came along, because that's what friends do."}]}

